<body><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Leren in transdisciplinair</span><span style="margin: 0px"> onderwijs is iets wat je doet</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Studenten leren niet alleen </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">over</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> complexe vraagstukken, ze werken er samen met anderen </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">in en aan</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">. Dat vraagt om actieve, participatieve en creatieve leeractiviteiten, verspreid over alle fasen van het onderwijsproject.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">In deze pagina vind je leeractiviteiten die passen bij transdisciplinaire</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> leerui</span><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(209, 52, 56); font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">t</span></span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">komsten én bij het proces van collaboratieve integratie.&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin: auto 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Overzicht: leeractiviteiten per fase van een transdisciplinair</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL"> project </span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">(Horn et al.,2022).&nbsp;</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><table aria-rowcount="7" data-clean-table="1" style="border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Fase</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Voorbeelden van leeractiviteiten</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">1. Verkenning van het complexe vraagstuk</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Veldbezoeken en contextobservaties</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Stakeholdermapping</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Storytelling met bewoners of ervaringsdeskundigen</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">- Visualisaties (mindmaps</span><span style="margin: 0px">, soft systems)</span>&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">2. Gezamenlijke vraag- en doelstelling formuleren</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Dialoogsessies met interne en externe partners</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Participatieve workshops</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Interviews en prioriteringssessies met stakeholders&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">3. Projectopzet en teamvorming</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Teambuilding met teamrollen en groepswaarden</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">- Pressure</span><span style="margin: 0px"> cookers om samen een werkvorm te doorlopen</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Gezamenlijke ontwerpsessies (projectcanvas)&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">4. Uitvoering &amp; integratie</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Co-creatie van producten (prototypes, interventies, events)</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Interdisciplinaire brainstorms</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Reflectieve groepsgesprekken</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Peerfeedback over proces en perspectieven&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">5. Verspreiding &amp; vervolg</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Presentaties op niet-academische locaties</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Projectrapporten in taal en vorm afgestemd op de praktijk</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Verkenning van vervolgvragen of samenwerkingen&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Doorlopend (in alle fasen)</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Reflectie-oefeningen (individueel en in groep)</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">- Mapping</span><span style="margin: 0px">-opdrachten (wat leren we van wie?)</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: WordVisiCarriageReturn_MSFontService, Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">&nbsp;</span><br style="margin: 0px"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">- Procesdialogen over samenwerking en leerervaring&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-style: italic; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Let op:</span></span><span style="margin: 0px"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"> Betrek studenten bij alle fasen – ook bij de start en de afronding van het project. Juist daar gebeurt vaak waardevol leren, zoals het bouwen van relaties, het omgaan met onzekerheid of het zichtbaar maken van impact.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Andere inspirerende werkvormen</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL"><span style="margin: 0px">Naast fasespecifieke</span><span style="margin: 0px"> leeractiviteiten, kun je gebruik maken van werkvormen die samenwerking, perspectiefwisseling en creativiteit stimuleren (Oudenampsen</span><span style="margin: 0px"> et al., 2024) :</span>&nbsp;</span></p><table aria-rowcount="7" data-clean-table="1" style="border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Leeractiviteit</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Doel</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="EN-US">MOOCs / e-modules / field trips</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Kennis opdoen uit andere disciplines of contexten&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Portfolio</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Persoonlijke ontwikkeling en rolbewustzijn zichtbaar maken&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold" lang="NL-NL">Multidisciplinair debat</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfd6e4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top;"><p style="font-family:Verdana, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; background-"><span style="margin: 0px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif" lang="NL-NL">Oefenen met perspectiefwisseling en standpuntbepaling&nbsp;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td st